==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]], Tropical Kalisa's Evolved Form was named "Tropical Kalisa X".
*Prior to [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]], Tropical Kalisa's Evolved Form name was inconsistent with that of her normal variant, in that it used "X" instead of the Greek letter "χ" (chi). Her [[Floral Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Easter counterpart]] also shared this inconsistency.
**This was likely from a mistranslation of her Japanese name, which uses X to complete the Excalibur pun.
*Her upper body is positioned ever so slightly higher in relation to her legs in Normal Form.

